      <text x="62" y="340">D</text><text x="202" y="340">I</text><text x="413" y="340">C</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
</section>

<section class="exercise" id="ex7">
  <div class="ex-title">Exercice 7</div>
  <p class="intro">Résoudre dans \(\mathbb R\) les équations suivantes :</p>
  <div class="eqgrid">
    <div class="eq">\(-x^2-2x+15=0\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(-3x^2+11x-10=0\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(x^2+x+1=0\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(x^2-\dfrac{28}{9}x+\dfrac13=0\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(x^2\sqrt2-\left(1+\dfrac1{\sqrt2}\right)x+\dfrac12=0\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(-x^2-\dfrac{31}{4}x+2=0\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(\dfrac{1}{2+\sqrt3}x^2+2x+\sqrt3=0\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(2024x^2+2023x-1=0\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(\dfrac{x+2}{2x+1}=\dfrac4{2x+1}\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(\dfrac{8x}{x-5}=1-3x\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(\sqrt{x^2+x+6}=2x-4\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(x^2+(2-\sqrt3)x-2\sqrt2=0\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\((\sqrt6-\sqrt2)x^2+2\sqrt2\,x-(\sqrt6+\sqrt2)=0\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(\dfrac{x^2+3x+4}{x^2+x+1}=\dfrac{x^2+4x+10}{x^2+2x+3}\)</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="exercise" id="ex8">
  <div class="ex-title">Exercice 8</div>
  <p class="intro">Résoudre dans \(\mathbb R\) les inéquations suivantes :</p>
  <div class="eqgrid">
    <div class="eq">\(2x^2+9x+9>0\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(-3x^2-5x+2>0\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(x^2-4\sqrt3\,x+12\le0\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(19x^2-18x-1\ge0\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(-29x^2-25x+4<0\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(\dfrac{5x+1}{x^2+x+1}\le\dfrac4{x+1}\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(7x-1>\dfrac{11x-5}{x+3}\)</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="exercise" id="ex9">
  <div class="ex-title">Exercice 9</div>
  <p class="intro">Soit dans \(\mathbb R\) l'équation \((E):x^2-2(a-1)x+4=0\), où \(a\) est un réel.</p>
  <div class="items">
    <div class="item"><span class="num">1</span><div>Déterminer le réel \(a\) pour que \(-1\) est une solution de \((E)\).</div></div>
    <div class="item"><span class="num">2</span><div>Déterminer l'ensemble des réels \(a\) pour que \((E)\) admet deux racines distinctes \(x'\) et \(x''\).</div></div>
    <div class="item"><span class="num">3</span><div>Déterminer \(a\) pour que \(x'^2+x''^2-x'x''=24\).</div></div>
    <div class="item"><span class="num">4</span><div>On donne \(a=-2\), sans calculer les racines de \((E)\), calculer
      \(A=\dfrac{x'+1}{x''-1}+\dfrac{x''+1}{x'-1}\) et \(B=x'^3+x''^3\).</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="exercise" id="ex10">
  <div class="ex-title">Exercice 10</div>
  <div class="items">
    <div class="item"><span class="num">1</span><div>Résoudre dans \(\mathbb R\) l'équation \(x^2-3x-4=0\).</div></div>
    <div class="item"><span class="num">2</span><div>Résoudre alors dans \(\mathbb R\) l'équation \((x^2+x+2)^2=3x^2+3x+10\).</div></div>
    <div class="item"><span class="num">3</span><div>Déterminer tous les réels \(a\) et \(b\) vérifiant :
      \(\begin{cases}a-b=2\sqrt3\\ ab=-2.\end{cases}\)</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="exercise" id="ex11">
  <div class="ex-title">Exercice 11</div>
  <div class="items">
    <div class="item"><span class="num">1</span><div>Résoudre dans \(\mathbb R\) l'équation \(4x^2-7x-2=0\).</div></div>
    <div class="item"><span class="num">2</span><div>En déduire l'ensemble des solutions dans \(\mathbb R\) de chacune des équations suivantes :
      <div class="section-note">
        <div><span class="sub">a</span>\(4(x^2+x)^2-7(x^2+x)-2=0\)</div>
        <div style="margin-top:10px"><span class="sub">b</span>\(4|x-1|-7\sqrt{|x-1|}-2=0\)</div>
      </div>
    </div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="exercise" id="ex12">
  <div class="ex-title">Exercice 12</div>
  <div class="items">
    <div class="item"><span class="num">1</span><div>Résoudre dans \(\mathbb R\) les inéquations suivantes :
      <div class="section-note">
        <div><span class="sub">a</span>\(2x^2+x-3\ge0\)</div>
        <div><span class="sub">b</span>\(\sqrt{2x^2+x-3}<x-1\)</div>
        <div><span class="sub">c</span>\(\sqrt{2x^2+x-3}+x^2+1>0\)</div>
      </div>
    </div></div>
    <div class="item"><span class="num">2</span><div>Soit \(F(x)=\dfrac{2x^2+x-3}{2x^2-x-6}\).
      <div class="section-note">
        <div><span class="sub">a</span>Déterminer l'ensemble \(D\) des réels \(x\) tels que \(F(x)\) a un sens.</div>
        <div><span class="sub">b</span>Simplifier \(F(x)\) pour tout \(x\in D\).</div>
        <div><span class="sub">c</span>Résoudre dans \(\mathbb R\) l'inéquation : \(F(x)\ge2x-2\).</div>
      </div>
    </div></div>
    <div class="item"><span class="num">3</span><div>Soit \(G(x)=\dfrac{2x^2-x-6}{-x^2+3|x|+4}\).
      <div class="section-note">
        <div><span class="sub">a</span>Déterminer l'ensemble \(D'\) des réels \(x\) tels que \(G(x)\) a un sens.</div>
        <div><span class="sub">b</span>Résoudre dans \(\mathbb R\) l'inéquation : \(G(x)\le0\).</div>
      </div>
    </div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="exercise" id="ex13">
  <div class="ex-title">Exercice 13</div>
  <p class="intro">Trouver les réels \(x\) et \(y\) tels que :</p>
  <div class="eqgrid">
    <div class="eq">\(x+y=24\) et \(xy=8\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(x-y=25\) et \(xy=-156\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(x^2+y^2=17\) et \(xy=4\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(x^2-y^2=40\) et \(xy=21\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(x+y=13\) et \(x^2+y^2=89\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(x^2+y^2=41\) et \((x-1)(y-1)=18\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(x^3+y^3=19\) et \(xy=1\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(x^2+y^3=2\) et \(x^2+y^2=8\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(x+y=2+\sqrt3\) et \(xy=\sqrt3\)</div>
    <div class="eq">\(2x^2y+2y^2x=3\) et \(4xy=3\)</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="exercise" id="ex14">
  <div class="ex-title">Exercice 14</div>
  <div class="items">
    <div class="item"><span class="num">1</span><div>Résoudre dans \(\mathbb R\) l'équation : \(x^2-7x-60=0\).</div></div>
    <div class="item"><span class="num">2</span><div>Déduire les solutions des équations :
      <div class="section-note">
        <div><span class="sub">a</span>\(x^2-7x-60+x^2+6x+5=0\)</div>
        <div><span class="sub">b</span>\((x^2-4x)^2-7x^2=60-28x\)</div>
        <div><span class="sub">c</span>\(|5x+6|=x-1\)</div>
      </div>
    </div></div>
    <div class="item"><span class="num">3</span><div>Soit \(ABC\) un triangle rectangle en \(A\) tel que \(BC=13\) et \(AB=AC=7\).
      <div class="section-note">
        <div><span class="sub">a</span>Montrer que \(AB\times AC=60\).</div>
        <div><span class="sub">b</span>Déterminer alors \(AB\) et \(AC\).</div>
      </div>
    </div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="exercise" id="ex15">
  <div class="ex-title">Exercice 15</div>

  <p class="intro"><strong>I.</strong> Résoudre dans \(\mathbb R\) les inéquations suivantes :</p>
  <div class="items">
    <div class="item"><span class="num">1</span><div>\(2x^2-x-3<0\)</div></div>
    <div class="item"><span class="num">2</span><div>\(|x^2-2x+3|<2x^2-x-3\)</div></div>
  </div>

  <p class="intro" style="margin-top:28px"><strong>II.</strong> On donne \(A(x)=3(x^2-1)^2+4(x^2-1)-7\).</p>
  <div class="items">
    <div class="item"><span class="num">1</span><div>Résoudre dans \(\mathbb R\) l'équation : \(A(x)=0\).</div></div>
    <div class="item"><span class="num">2</span><div>Factoriser \(A(x)\).</div></div>
    <div class="item"><span class="num">3</span><div>Résoudre dans \(\mathbb R\) l'inéquation : \(A(x)\ge0\).</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

